WEBVTT

00:01:29.252 --> 00:01:30.253
(Laughter)

00:01:30.336 --> 00:01:31.337
(Applause)

00:01:32.713 --> 00:01:36.300
I regendered a couple
of the main characters,

00:01:36.300 --> 00:01:37.844
and I added new scenes,

00:01:37.844 --> 00:01:41.639
like one where a female hobbit
devised a clever plan

00:01:41.639 --> 00:01:43.474
to foil the Balrog,

00:01:43.474 --> 00:01:48.604
a monster who caused the death
of one of my favorite characters.

00:01:50.064 --> 00:01:53.693
By reimagining Tolkien’s fantasy world,

00:01:53.693 --> 00:01:56.112
I was creating a place

00:01:56.112 --> 00:01:58.281
where someone like me could feel at home.

00:01:59.991 --> 00:02:02.243
Writing my story gave me comfort.